  "changes": [
    "Re-encoded the attributed ten-second regression video to all six VP9 profile/bit-depth pairs; audio omitted.",
    "Profiles 0 and 2 use 4:2:0; profiles 1 and 3 use 4:4:4 converted from the existing 4:2:0 source.",
    "10-bit and 12-bit seeds convert the 8-bit source and are codec/encryption-path fixtures, not higher-bit-depth source-quality references.",
    "Two-pass encoding retains ordinary hidden altref frames and superframe indexes, with 48-frame key intervals at 24 frames per second."
  ],
